OL,3,GNEWSAStudents 'knackered' after
OL,4,A200-mile punt challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour students admit they are "pretty
OL,7,Fknackered" after punting more than 200
OL,8,Fmiles (320km) from Oxford to Cambridge
OL,9,Fto raise thousands of pounds for
OL,10,Fcharity.
OL,12,FCharlie Swinfen, Stefan Narinian, Beth
OL,13,FErskine and Ryan Vowles, from the
OL,14,FUniversity of Cambridge's St John's
OL,15,FCollege, set off on 24 September.
OL,17,FThe 11-day challenge took in the Oxford
OL,18,FCanal, Grand Union Canal, River Nene,
OL,19,FDenver Sluice and River Ouse before
OL,20,Ffinishing on the River Cam on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
